OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen to batter Wales coast
OL,4,Awith 70mph winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FTravel disruption and power cuts are
OL,7,Fexpected as Storm Austen hits Wales.
OL,9,FThe Met Office said the storm, the
OL,10,Ffirst named one of the autumn, will
OL,11,Fbring a spell of strong winds up to
OL,12,F70mph (112km/h) overnight on Thursday
OL,13,Fand into Friday, mainly in coastal
OL,14,Fareas.
OL,16,FTwo yellow warnings for Wales are in
OL,17,Fplace for Friday, with periods of heavy
OL,18,Frain also expected. The Met Office said
OL,19,Finjuries and danger to life from flying
OL,20,Fdebris were possible.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
