OL,3,GNEWSAStorm Austen to batter Wales coast
OL,4,Awith 70mph winds
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome roads and bridges may close,
OL,7,Fdamage to buildings could happen, and
OL,8,Flonger journey times and cancellations
OL,9,Fto public transport are possible.
